Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single lonely night, the young boy desperately wished time would just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one miraculous day, his impossible wish finally came entirely true for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.23,0:00:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He could suddenly freeze everything around him, including the pouring rain and people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, standing above the frozen world made him feel like an almighty god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He used his strange power to effortlessly win fights and avoid all emotional pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But slowly, a terrifying and unexpected consequence began emerging from the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single time he stopped time, someone he truly loved forgot him forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Deeply desperate, he stopped time one final time and whispered his honest truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He let time flow again, choosing to finally grow older instead of living forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he embraced a beautiful life where he could finally stay with everyone.
